ory":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $511M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":0,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 61.5%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"流動比率 = 0.72"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":80.89,"default_fair_val":80.89,"premium_pct":-31.4,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":7,"pe_forward":6.2,"pb_trailing":1.6,"pb_forward":1.4,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":2.8,"fcf_to_ev":5.86,"fcf_to_mcap":8.84,"liab_to_assets":61.5,"cash_to_assets":8.1,"current_ratio":0.72,"roe":23.1,"roa":8.4,"moat":{"ticker":"VIST","period":"2026Q3","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":6,"comment_zh":"Vista Energy 在能源產業中，其品牌定價權相對有限。作為一家專注於石油和天然氣勘探與生產的公司，其產品本質上是商品，價格主要受市場供需和全球宏觀經濟因素影響，而非品牌溢價。雖然公司在墨西哥市場建立了穩固的營運基礎，並可能透過效率和可靠性贏得客戶的信任，但這更多體現為營運優勢而非強勢品牌定價能力。與消費品或服務業的強勢品牌相比，Vista Energy 的品牌在定價方面缺乏顯著的獨立性，其利潤空間更容易受到大宗商品價格波動的擠壓。因此，在品牌定價權方面，其護城河屬於中等水平。","comment_en":"Vista Energy has relatively limited brand pricing power within the energy sector. As a company focused on oil and gas exploration and production, its products are essentially commodities, with prices primarily influenced by market supply and demand and global macroeconomic factors, rather than brand premiums. While the company has established a solid operational base in the Mexican market and may earn customer trust through efficiency and reliability, this reflects operational advantages more than strong brand pricing power. Compared to strong brands in consumer goods or services, Vista Energy's brand lacks significant independence in pricing, and its profit margins are more susceptible to pressure from commodity price volatility. Therefore, its moat in terms of brand pricing power is at a moderate level."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Vista Energy 在專利和監管壁壘方面得分中等。作為一家能源勘探與生產公司，其核心業務並非高度依賴專利技術，而是依賴對油氣儲量的勘探、開採技術和營運效率。然而，能源行業受到嚴格的環境、安全和營運法規監管。在墨西哥這樣一個特定市場營運，公司需要遵守當地複雜的監管框架，這本身構成了一定的進入壁壘。成功獲取和維持開採許可證、遵守環保標準等，都需要專業知識和持續投入，對新進入者構成挑戰。但這些壁壘更多是行業性質和地域性監管，而非獨創性專利帶來的超額利潤。","comment_en":"Vista Energy scores moderately in patents and regulatory barriers. As an exploration and production company, its core business is not highly dependent on patented technology but rather on oil and gas reserves, extraction techniques, and operational efficiency. However, the energy industry is subject to stringent environmental, safety, and operational regulations. Operating in a specific market like Mexico requires adherence to a complex local regulatory framework, which itself constitutes a certain entry barrier. Successfully obtaining and maintaining exploration licenses, complying with environmental standards, etc., require specialized knowledge and continuous investment, posing challenges for new entrants. However, these barriers are more inherent to the industry and regional regulations rather than creating excess profits through proprietary patents."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":4,"comment_zh":"Vista Energy 的客戶轉換成本相對較低。其主要客戶群體是需要能源供應的工業和商業用戶。雖然這些客戶需要穩定的能源供應，但他們通常有多個供應商可供選擇，並且在合約到期後，轉換供應商的技術和行政成本並不算極高。一旦客戶找到價格更優、供應更穩定的替代方案，或者出於戰略考量，轉換到其他能源公司並非難事。因此，Vista Energy 難以透過高昂的轉換成本來鎖定客戶，這方面的護城河相對較弱。","comment_en":"Vista Energy has relatively low customer switching costs. Its primary customer base consists of industrial and commercial users requiring energy supply. While these customers need stable energy supply, they typically have multiple suppliers to choose from, and the technical and administrative costs of switching suppliers after contract expiration are not prohibitively high. If customers find better pricing or more stable supply alternatives, or for strategic reasons, switching to another energy company is not difficult. Therefore, Vista Energy struggles to lock in customers through high switching costs, making this aspect of its moat relatively weak."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Vista Energy 的業務模式幾乎不存在網絡效應。網絡效應是指產品或服務的價值隨著用戶數量的增加而增加。在能源勘探與生產領域，公司之間的競爭主要基於資源儲量、開採技術、成本控制和市場准入，而非用戶之間的互動或依賴。Vista Energy 的客戶購買的是能源商品，他們不會因為有更多其他客戶購買 Vista 的能源而增加其對 Vista 能源的需求或價值。因此，網絡效應在這家公司幾乎不構成任何護城河。","comment_en":"Vista Energy's business model exhibits virtually no network effects. Network effects occur when the value of a product or service increases with the number of users. In the oil and gas exploration and production sector, competition among companies is primarily based on resource reserves, extraction technology, cost control, and market access, rather than user interaction or dependency. Vista Energy's customers purchase energy commodities; they do not increase their demand for or value of Vista's energy simply because more other customers are buying it. Therefore, network effects constitute almost no moat for this company."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Vista Energy 在規模成本優勢方面具有一定的護城河。作為一家在墨西哥市場營運的能源公司，其規模使其能夠在勘探、開採、運輸和銷售環節實現規模經濟。較大的營運規模有助於攤薄固定成本，並可能在採購設備、服務和勞動力方面獲得更有利的價格。此外，在特定區域市場深耕多年，可能建立了更有效率的供應鏈和物流網絡。相較於小型競爭者，Vista Energy 的規模優勢使其在成本控制上更具競爭力，能夠在商品價格波動時更好地維持利潤率，這構成了一個堅固的護城河。","comment_en":"Vista Energy possesses a certain moat in terms of cost advantage from scale. As an energy company operating in the Mexican market, its scale allows it to achieve economies of scale in exploration, extraction, transportation, and sales. Larger operational scale helps spread fixed costs and may enable more favorable pricing for procurement of equipment, services, and labor. Furthermore, years of deep engagement in specific regional markets may have established more efficient supply chains and logistics networks. Compared to smaller competitors, Vista Energy's scale advantage makes it more competitive in cost control, enabling it to better maintain profit margins during commodity price fluctuations, thus forming a solid moat."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Vista Energy 在獨特的地理資產方面擁有較強的護城河。公司在墨西哥擁有重要的石油和天然氣儲量，並獲得了在特定區域進行勘探和生產的權利。這些油氣田的地理位置、儲量規模和開採難易度構成了其獨特的資產價值。墨西哥的能源市場具有一定的准入壁壘和政策複雜性，Vista Energy 作為當地重要的參與者，其已獲得的開採權和營運經驗使其在該區域市場處於有利地位。這些特定且難以複製的地理資產是其競爭優勢的重要來源。","comment_en":"Vista Energy holds a strong moat in unique geographic assets. The company possesses significant oil and gas reserves in Mexico and has obtained exploration and production rights in specific areas. The geographic location, reserve size, and ease of extraction of these oil and gas fields constitute their unique asset value. Mexico's energy market has certain entry barriers and policy complexities. As a key local player, Vista Energy's existing extraction rights and operational experience place it in an advantageous position within this regional market. These specific and difficult-to-replicate geographic assets are a significant source of its competitive advantage."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Vista Energy 在營運效率方面展現出堅固的護城河。公司在石油和天然氣的勘探、開採和生產過程中，透過持續的技術優化和流程改進，能夠有效控制成本並提高產出效率。其在墨西哥市場的長期營運經驗，使其能夠更好地應對當地複雜的地質條件和法規環境。相較於效率較低的競爭對手，Vista Energy 的營運效率使其能夠在相同的成本結構下獲得更高的產量，或在相同的產量下實現更低的成本。這種持續的營運優勢是其在競爭激烈的能源市場中保持盈利能力的關鍵。","comment_en":"Vista Energy demonstrates a solid moat in operational efficiency. Through continuous technological optimization and process improvements in oil and gas exploration, extraction, and production, the company can effectively control costs and enhance output efficiency. Its long-term operational experience in the Mexican market allows it to better navigate complex local geological conditions and regulatory environments. Compared to less efficient competitors, Vista Energy's operational efficiency enables it to achieve higher yields under the same cost structure or lower costs for the same output. This sustained operational advantage is key to maintaining its profitability in the competitive energy market."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Vista Energy 的資本配置能力顯示出堅固的護城河。公司在過去幾年中展現出穩健的財務管理和對股東回報的承諾。透過自由現金流的產生和有效的再投資策略，公司能夠在維持營運和擴張的同時，也進行股息支付和股票回購。其 ROE 和 ROA 指標（23.1% 和 8.4%）顯示出良好的資本運用效率。管理層在平衡短期營運需求與長期投資機會，以及在資本結構（現金與負債比例）的管理上，表現出審慎和有效的決策能力，這對於能源行業的資本密集型特點尤為重要。","comment_en":"Vista Energy's capital allocation capability indicates a solid moat. The company has demonstrated sound financial management and a commitment to shareholder returns in recent years. Through the generation of free cash flow and effective reinvestment strategies, the company can maintain operations and expansion while also distributing dividends and repurchasing shares. Its ROE and ROA metrics (23.1% and 8.4%) show good capital utilization efficiency. Management exhibits prudent and effective decision-making in balancing short-term operational needs with long-term investment opportunities, as well as in managing its capital structure (cash to debt ratio), which is particularly important given the capital-intensive nature of the energy industry."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Vista Energy 在客戶留存方面得分中等。雖然公司在墨西哥能源市場建立了穩定的客戶基礎，並透過可靠的供應和服務贏得客戶信任，但能源作為一種商品，客戶的忠誠度往往受到價格和供應穩定性的顯著影響。一旦市場出現更具吸引力的報價或供應商，客戶仍有可能轉移。公司需要持續透過優化成本、提升服務質量和建立長期合作關係來維持客戶留存。與具有強烈品牌忠誠度或高轉換成本的行業相比，其客戶留存的壁壘相對較弱。","comment_en":"Vista Energy scores moderately in customer retention. While the company has established a stable customer base in the Mexican energy market and earns customer trust through reliable supply and service, energy as a commodity means customer loyalty is significantly influenced by price and supply stability. Customers may still switch if more attractive offers or suppliers emerge in the market. The company needs to continuously maintain customer retention by optimizing costs, improving service quality, and building long-term partnerships. Compared to industries with strong brand loyalty or high switching costs, its customer retention moat is relatively weaker."},"m10_durability":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Vista Energy 的業務模式具有較強的持久性。作為一家從事石油和天然氣勘探與生產的公司，其核心業務滿足了社會對能源的基本需求，這種需求在可預見的未來仍然是剛性的。儘管面臨向可再生能源轉型的長期趨勢，但化石燃料在短期和中期內仍將是全球能源結構的重要組成部分。Vista Energy 在墨西哥市場的穩固地位、其擁有的儲量資產以及持續的營運效率，使其能夠在不斷變化的能源格局中保持競爭力。其業務的基礎性需求和公司自身的營運實力，構成了其業務持久性的堅實基礎。","comment_en":"Vista Energy's business model exhibits strong durability. As a company engaged in oil and gas exploration and production, its core business meets society's fundamental need for energy, a demand that remains inelastic for the foreseeable future. Despite the long-term trend towards renewable energy transition, fossil fuels will continue to be a significant component of the global energy mix in the short and medium term. Vista Energy's solid position in the Mexican market, its reserve assets, and its ongoing operational efficiency enable it to remain competitive amidst the evolving energy landscape. The fundamental nature of its business and the company's own operational strengths form a solid foundation for its business durability."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Vista Energy 的護城河主要建立在其獨特的地理資產（M6）和規模成本優勢（M5）之上，這使其在墨西哥能源市場中佔據了有利地位。其營運效率（M7）和資本配置能力（M8）也提供了堅實的支持，確保了公司在商品價格波動下仍能保持盈利。然而，其品牌定價權（M1）、客戶轉換成本（M3）和網絡效應（M4）相對較弱，這限制了其作為「收費橋」或強勢品牌型企業的潛力。總體而言，Vista Energy 屬於一種「商品型」或「資源型」的企業，其價值更多來自於對稀缺資源的有效開採和管理，而非依賴於難以複製的客戶關係或品牌忠誠度。其護城河是堅固的，但非無懈可擊。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Vista Energy's moat is primarily built upon its unique geographic assets (M6) and cost advantages from scale (M5), positioning it favorably in the Mexican energy market. Its operational efficiency (M7) and capital allocation capabilities (M8) also provide solid support, ensuring profitability amidst commodity price volatility. However, its brand pricing power (M1), customer switching costs (M3), and network effects (M4) are relatively weak, limiting its potential as a 'toll bridge' or strong brand-centric enterprise. Overall, Vista Energy can be characterized as a 'commodity' or 'resource-based' company, deriving its value more from the effective extraction and management of scarce resources rather than relying on inimitable customer relationships or brand loyalty. Its moat is solid, but not impenetrable.","evidenceHash":"1d8bd42dcbbfcb573ec0253e524a924f2d08c34ff68c0a8109640d7730c7f6e5","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Gemini"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null,"evidenceHash":"1d8bd42dcbbfcb573ec0253e524a924f2d08c34ff68c0a8109640d7730c7f6e5","currentEvidenceHash":"1d8bd42dcbbfcb573ec0253e524a924f2d08c34ff68c0a8109640d7730c7f6e5"},"fScore":{"score":7,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-13T07:54:37.545Z","evidenceHash":"900648e9784f372b5430f2f6a8f1a1b99c61f4b17a1ea8e5aba739ff1f55246e"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"highRisk","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-13T07:54:37.545Z","evidenceHash":"900648e9784f372b5430f2f6a8f1a1b99c61f4b17a1ea8e5aba739ff1f55246e"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/VIST.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/VIST.png","website":"https://www.vistaenergy.com","ceo":"Miguel Matias Galuccio","full_time_employees":"584","description":"Headquartered in Mexico City, Mexico, Vista Energy, S.A.B. de C.V., an entity established in 2017, concentrates on the exploration and production of oil and natural gas throughout Latin America through its various subsidiaries. A significant portion of its holdings, approximately 183,100 acres, is located in Vaca Muerta, complemented by other operational producing assets in Argentina and Mexico. As of December 31, 2021, the company's proved reserves amounted to 181.6 million barrels of oil equivalent (MMBOE). The firm, initially known as Vista Oil & Gas, S.A.B. de C.V., adopted its current name, Vista Energy, S.A.B. de C.V., in April 2022.","description_en":"Headquartered in Mexico City, Mexico, Vista Energy, S.A.B. de C.V., an entity established in 2017, concentrates on the exploration and production of oil and natural gas throughout Latin America through its various subsidiaries. A significant portion of its holdings, approximately 183,100 acres, is located in Vaca Muerta, complemented by other operational producing assets in Argentina and Mexico. As of December 31, 2021, the company's proved reserves amounted to 181.6 million barrels of oil equivalent (MMBOE). The firm, initially known as Vista Oil & Gas, S.A.B. de C.V., adopted its current name, Vista Energy, S.A.B. de C.V., in April 2022.","description_zh":"Vista Energy, S.A.B. de C.V.（美股代碼：VIST）為 Energy 領域之重要企業，專注於 Oil & Gas Exploration & Production 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"Torre Mapfre, 243 Ps de la Reforma Ave","city":"Mexico City","state":"DF","zip":"06500","country":"MX","phone":"52 55 8647 0128","full_address":"Torre Mapfre, 243 Ps de la Reforma Ave, Mexico City, DF 06500, MX","range_52w":"43.71-81.44","year_high":81.44,"year_low":43.71,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":43.71,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"top_holders":[],"insider_trades":[{"date":"2026-10-05","name":"VERA PINTO PABLO MANUEL","title":"officer: Chief Financial Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"D-Return","shares":67297,"price":17.83,"total_val":1.2},{"date":"2026-10-05","name":"CHERNACOV ALEJANDRO","title":"officer: Strategic Planning and IRO","is_buy":null,"action":"D-Return","shares":61179,"price":17.83,"total_val":1.09},{"date":"2026-10-05","name":"Galuccio Miguel Matias","title":"officer: Chief Executive Officer","is_buy":null,"action":"D-Return","shares":305895,"price":17.83,"total_val"